{"id":"wb-2-28","name":"色拉寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"色拉寺","text":"色拉寺（藏语：སེ་ར་དགོན，威利转写：se ra dgon，藏语拼音：Sêra Gön）位于西藏自治区拉萨市城关区娘热街道色拉乌孜山南麓，是藏传佛教格鲁派六大寺院之一，由宗喀巴的弟子“大慈法王”绛钦却杰在公元15世纪初创建。1982年，色拉寺被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第二批全国重点文物保护单位之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%89%B2%E6%8B%89%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93415841,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93415841","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b9ee650e87ff228c8fe2ac48.jpg","title":"Sera_Monastery4.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sera_Monastery4.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Sera_Monastery4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Antoine Taveneaux","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Sera Monastery","width":320,"height":214}}